<title>USA: Home Shopping in Japan joint venture.</title>
<headline>Home Shopping in Japan joint venture.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PETERSBURG, Fla. 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Home Shopping Network Inc said on Tuesday that it entered a joint venture with  Jupiter Programming Co to form SHOP Channel, Japan's first live television shopping network.</p>
<p>Home Shopping said it held a 30 percent stake in the venture and Jupiter has a 70 percent stake.</p>
<p>Jupiter is a joint venture between Tele-Communications International Inc and Sumitomo Corp of Japan.</p>
</text>
